Give me an example.

10:32.380 --> 10:35.620
Where is the negative money in the standard physics ledger right now?

10:35.760 --> 10:40.220
Take quantum electrodynamics, QED, which is the quantum theory of light and electrons.

10:40.740 --> 10:44.640
It is arguably the most precisely tested theory in the history of science.

10:44.640 --> 10:50.340
When physicists formulate QED using what is called the Lorentz gauge, which is a mathematical

