In particle physics, particles are either bosons, which like to clump together, or fermions, which violently refuse to occupy the same state.

12:30.440 --> 12:30.560
Right.

12:31.100 --> 12:37.280
A Fadiv Popov ghost is mathematically treated as a fermion, but it has integer spin like a boson.

12:37.280 --> 12:45.260
It is a complete fundamental mathematical contradiction, but it exists in the admissibility manifold to balance the books.

12:45.660 --> 12:52.660
And again, through something called BRST symmetry, these ghosts are completely restricted from ever appearing in the observable manifold.

12:53.160 --> 12:53.820
Let me get this straight.

12:54.160 --> 12:56.780
The theory of light uses negative probabilities.

12:57.420 --> 13:03.120
The theory of the strong nuclear force uses literal mathematical ghosts that violate the laws of quantum statistics.

13:03.540 --> 13:05.600
And the physics community is perfectly fine with this.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.860
They accept it. They give out Nobel Prizes for it.

13:07.880 --> 13:08.900
They teach it in grad school.

13:09.140 --> 13:09.240
Yep.

13:09.420 --> 13:14.720
So why, when it came to gravity, did everyone suddenly decide that the ledger had to be entirely positive?

13:15.220 --> 13:19.660
Because the ghosts in QED and the strong force are essentially bookkeeping tricks.

13:20.120 --> 13:22.700
