37:52.560 --> 37:53.900
Let's go back to Plato's cave.

37:54.580 --> 38:00.140
In the larger internal space, the admissibility manifold, the universe might be entirely deterministic,

38:00.300 --> 38:04.460
entirely governed by smooth, complex geometric flows without any randomness at all.

38:04.500 --> 38:05.540
But we can't see it.

38:05.680 --> 38:05.900
Right.

38:06.220 --> 38:10.800
Because we humans and our physical measuring instruments only exist in the observable manifold.

38:10.800 --> 38:12.240
You're fundamentally restricted.

38:12.240 --> 38:16.580
We only perceive the flattened, squared, un-shorcastic probabilities.

38:17.380 --> 38:19.120
We see the blurry shadow on the cave wall.

38:19.500 --> 38:23.740
And because we can't predict exactly where the shadow will move next, we invent quantum

38:23.740 --> 38:24.180
uncertainty.

38:24.520 --> 38:30.360
But the object casting the shadow is a perfectly definite, highly complex geometric structure.

38:30.360 --> 38:34.180
We are literally living in the shadow of the admissibility manifold.

38:34.820 --> 38:39.860
We are mistaking the blurry limitation of our vision for a fundamental law of physics.

38:40.320 --> 38:45.540
And if we are fundamentally misunderstanding how quantum probability works, if we've mistaken

38:45.540 --> 38:49.880
the shadow for the object, then we might be completely wrong about our ultimate theories

38:49.880 --> 38:50.500
of everything.

38:50.500 --> 38:54.920
Which brings us directly to the implications for the biggest theoretical game in town for

38:54.920 --> 38:55.860
the last 50 years.

38:55.860 --> 38:58.840
Yes, the consequences for string theory.

38:58.840 --> 39:02.220
Let's explore Flyxion's derived interface conjecture.

39:02.740 --> 39:07.640
If quantum mechanics and general relativity are just shadows, what are they shadows of?

39:07.720 --> 39:08.960
What is an interface theory?

39:09.380 --> 39:14.240
The conjecture states that observable space-time theories are not fundamental descriptions of

39:14.240 --> 39:14.680
reality.

