44:50.760 --> 44:54.440
the quantum interactions cause that coupling strength to change to run.

44:55.060 --> 44:56.640
Eventually, at a much lower energy,

44:56.920 --> 44:58.680
the interaction becomes strongly coupled

44:58.680 --> 45:02.320
and essentially freezes out, generating a physical mass scale.

45:02.440 --> 45:05.980
This is exactly how the mass of the proton is generated in QCD.

45:06.440 --> 45:08.180
The mass comes from the binding energy.

45:08.920 --> 45:11.380
Quadratic gravity does the exact same thing.

45:11.920 --> 45:15.220
A weakly coupled interaction at the incredibly high Planck scale

45:15.220 --> 45:18.680
will dynamically generate a strongly coupled mass scale

45:18.680 --> 45:20.160
exponentially lower down.

45:20.640 --> 45:24.080
If the Higgs boson is a composite particle in this framework,

45:24.480 --> 45:27.800
its mass is naturally set by this dynamically generated scale,

45:28.300 --> 45:29.720
entirely without fine-tuning.

45:30.100 --> 45:32.660
It elegantly explains why the weak nuclear force

45:32.660 --> 45:34.280
